+<td>bench::texbat (kshana bench texbat-windows and texbat-pd): streams one TEXBAT recording (complex int16, 25 Msps), refuses a file whose SHA-256 or size differs from the pinned manifest and then writes nothing, acquires PRNs 1 to 32 once and tracks them through the recording, and writes per 1 s window the early-minus-late imbalance S, the prompt-power fluctuation P and the window score against synthetic thresholds (the 99th percentiles over the 61 of 64 synthetic windows that acquire); texbat-pd adds the in-band power rise over the recording&#39;s own windows 0 to 59 (tau 1.0 dB). Writes scores only, never IQ samples</td>
