+<img class="theme-light" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%221280%22 height=%22620%22 viewBox=%220 0 1280 620%22 role=%22img%22 aria-labelledby=%22t d%22%3E%3Ctitle id=%22t%22%3EArchitecture: front doors, one dispatch, eight layers, one ledger%3C/title%3E%3Cdesc id=%22d%22%3EKshana's architecture in layers. Five front doors (command line, Python, JavaScript and WebAssembly, the MCP server and the JetBrains plugin) reach one api::run_toml, a typed dispatch over 92 kinds. Beneath it sit eight domain layers: Time and frames (timescales · jd2 · precession, nutation · cio · frames · eop); Clocks and timing (allan · clock_state · holdover, telecom_timing · slot_timing); Inertial and fusion (inertial · fusion · kalman, mapmatch · gravimeter · altpnt); GNSS and integrity (gnss_sim · pvt · raim · sbas, jamming · spectrum · spoof_*); Astrodynamics (sgp4 · tle · propagator · forces, orbit_determination · maneuver); LEO PNT (leo_signal · leo_pass, leo_navmsg · leo_fusion · chain); Moon, Mars, deep space (lunar_* · mars_pnt · radiometric, deepspace_od · ccsds_tdm); Missions and studies (campaign · constellation, passes · resilience · study). All of them rest on a shared core (types, scenario, the run record) and are cross-referenced by the verification module, the machine-checked matrix of 401 capabilities that is the single source of truth for every VALIDATED, MODELLED or PARTNER label.%3C/desc%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3Cpattern id=%22dots1%22 width=%2222%22 height=%2222%22 patternUnits=%22userSpaceOnUse%22%3E%3Ccircle cx=%2211%22 cy=%2211%22 r=%221.1%22 fill=%22%23D1D6E1%22/%3E%3C/pattern%3E%3Cpath id=%22m50%22 d=%22M24 0 232 710H368L576 0H467L300 601L133 0ZM140 185 172 282H428L460 185Z%22/%3E%3Cpath id=%22m51%22 d=%22M67 0V710H288Q401 710 466 653Q530 596 530 498Q530 447 508 408Q485 369 448 347Q412 325 371 322L367 334Q441 331 478 301Q514 270 520 202L538 0H433L417 182Q414 217 402 238Q390 259 365 268Q340 277 296 277H172V0ZM172 375H28